WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.815
One last thing:

00:00:00.865 --> 00:00:04.969
there are many conditions in which the heart doesn’t function correctly.

00:00:05.019 --> 00:00:08.950
Anatomically, some heart conditions change the pathway flow of blood.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.976
One example that we had mentioned before is an atrial septal defect.

00:00:13.026 --> 00:00:18.169
The septum is the muscular wall that separates the right and left side of the heart. So,

00:00:18.219 --> 00:00:24.950
a septal defect could mean an opening and oxygen-rich blood could mix with oxygen-poor blood.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.855
Depending on the size, this can cause future problems such as an abnormal heartbeat,

00:00:29.905 --> 00:00:32.950
stroke, or potentially heart failure in severe cases.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.080
Some medications may help the symptoms or surgery can be an option.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:41.950
There continues to be more advancements for treating cardiovascular conditions.
